<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA 1996 GROUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA 1996 GROUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA preliminary</p>
<p>group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							  1996	 1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit			24.94 vs   17.31</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			  23.38 vs   13.72</p>
<p>    group net profit				14.44 vs    8.42</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales				217.52 vs  168.44</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			 183.97 vs  145.10</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		     0.00 vs    0.87</p>
<p>    group income tax				 9.11 vs    5.15</p>
<p>    group other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		     1.53 vs    0.98</p>
<p>    group financial costs			  3.11 vs    3.78</p>
<p>    group investment				11.75 vs    4.48</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
